From 768fb974eada692b79f3c92a41fe8dbf3413843c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 19:41:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 08/30] capi: macOS dylib cross-build with Zig (arm64, x86_64
 avx2/compat), Delphi macOS support

- cmake/toolchains/zig-macos.cmake + zig wrappers; tzfile.h stub for ICU
- scripts/capi/build-macos.sh: static ICU per arch, final link with ld64.lld
  (exact export list, @rpath install name, ad-hoc signature)
- capi CMake: @rpath install name and export list on Apple
- tests: portable FP unmasking (macOS x86_64 via registers; arm64 has no traps)
- Laya.pas: liblaya.dylib on macOS; LayaTests: MXCSR check only on x64

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LAsYHSSgSysMFa8MKPJWgL
